@page "/"

<PageTitle>Crypt Application</PageTitle>

<h1>Welcome to Crypt Application</h1>

<p>
    This is a Kiro-ready .NET 10 skeleton for small business web apps.
    The template ships with its own `.kiro` folder, so a new project starts
    Kiro-ready on day one.
</p>

<h2>Getting Started</h2>

<ul>
    <li><a href="/api/health">Health Check API</a> - Verify the application is running</li>
    <li><a href="/api/items">Items API</a> - Example feature endpoints</li>
</ul>

<h2>Features</h2>

<p>
    This template includes:
</p>
<ul>
    <li>ASP.NET Core with Blazor Web App (static SSR)</li>
    <li>EF Core 10 with SQLite (default) or PostgreSQL (optional)</li>
    <li>Minimal APIs under /api</li>
    <li>xUnit tests with in-memory database</li>
    <li>Docker and docker-compose support</li>
    <li>Dark theme with WCAG AA accessible colors</li>
</ul>

